  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="16" /><char style="w" strong="H408">Do not</char> <char style="w" strong="H1961">be</char> <char style="w" strong="H7235">overly</char> <char style="w" strong="H6662">righteous</char>, <char style="w" strong="H408">and do not</char> <char style="w" strong="H3148">make yourself too</char> <char style="w" strong="H2449">wise</char>. <char style="w" strong="H4100">Why</char> <char style="w" strong="H8074">should you destroy yourself?</char> <verse style="v" number="17" /><char style="w" strong="H408">Do not</char> <char style="w" strong="H7235">be excessively</char> <char style="w" strong="H7561">wicked</char>, <char style="w" strong="H408">and do not</char> <char style="w" strong="H1961">be</char> <char style="w" strong="H5530">a fool</char>. <char style="w" strong="H4100">Why</char> <char style="w" strong="H4191">should you die</char> <char style="w" strong="H3808">before</char> <char style="w" strong="H6256">your time</char>? <verse style="v" number="18" /><char style="w" strong="H2896">It is good</char> <char style="w" strong="H834">-</char> <char style="w" strong="H270">to grasp</char> <char style="w" strong="H2088">the one</char> <char style="w" strong="H1571">and</char> <char style="w" strong="H408">not</char> <char style="w" strong="H5117">let the other slip</char> <char style="w" strong="H853">-</char> <char style="w" strong="H2088">from</char> <char style="w" strong="H3027">your hand</char>. <char style="w" strong="H3588">For</char> <char style="w" strong="H3373">he who fears</char> <char style="w" strong="H430">God</char> <char style="w" strong="H3318">will follow</char> <char style="w" strong="H853">-</char> <char style="w" strong="H3605">both [warnings]</char>.<note style="f" caller="+"><char style="fr">7:18 </char><char style="ft">Or </char><char style="fqa">will avoid all extremes</char></note></para>
