  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="23" /><char style="w" strong="H3605">All</char> <char style="w" strong="H2090">this</char> <char style="w" strong="H5254">I tested</char> <char style="w" strong="H2451">by wisdom, [saying]</char>, “<char style="w" strong="H559">I resolve</char> <char style="w" strong="H2449">to be wise</char>.” <char style="w" strong="H1931">But it</char> <char style="w" strong="H7350">was beyond</char> <char style="w" strong="H4480">me</char>. <verse style="v" number="24" /><char style="w" strong="H4100">What</char> <char style="w" strong="H1961">exists</char> <char style="w" strong="H7350">is out of reach</char> <char style="w" strong="H6013">and very deep</char> <char style="w" strong="H6013">. . .</char>. <char style="w" strong="H4310">Who</char> <char style="w" strong="H4672">can fathom it</char>?</para>
